# The image decoder is generated: wasm2c's C from ext/decode/decode.wasm,
# and the runtime that came with it. Its memory accesses are checked by
# its own code, and its indirect calls go through the function type wasm
# gave them, not C's, which UBSan's function check would flag on every
# call_indirect; instrumenting it would also take the sanitizer builds
# fifteen minutes.
src:*/decode/*
